<title>USA: U.S. business loans fell $1.1 bln in Jan 1 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans fell $1.1 bln in Jan 1 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks fell $1.1 billion to $787.0 billion in the week ended Jan 1, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
</text>
